msgctxt "76"
msgid ""
"It's a total piece of cake, sweet cheeks. No tougher than\r\n"
"handin' out a few flyers. You seen people doin' that before,\r\n"
"right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "Yeah, I guess so..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"You should be thanking your lucky stars we're givin' you\r\n"
"this shot, girlie. We got kids floodin' our office nonstop\r\n"
"just begging for a chance to rake in the dough with us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid ""
"Now, all you gotta do is take these envelopes, and hand 'em\r\n"
"over to any ol' schmuck who asks you for one. Do that, and\r\n"
"they'll pay you a cool 20,000 yen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "Haruka? What are you doing?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "Oh, Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "Well, looks like that's our cue. Catch ya 'round, little lady!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "Haruka. Who were those guys?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"Oh, uh... Nobody! Just some people asking for directions!\r\n"
"Well, look at the time! The shopping can't wait forever!"
msgstr ""

